  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Two given lines intersect <math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> they must be coplanar<br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
